<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεφ-άλλομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap down against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἵππων κατεπάλμενος ἀντίος ἔστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.94
				</span></i>
			 (where Sch.A read <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-απ-άλμενος</span>); <i>swoop down upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα . . νηὸς ὑπὲρ πάσης κατεπάλμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.583
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.120
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέπαλτο</span>
			<i>leapt upon</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				478
			</span></i>; <i>leapt down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					48.614
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπάλλομαι, καταπάλμενος,
				καταπαλτός</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
